<title>SRI LANKA: S.Lanka Seylan H1 net down 43 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Lanka Seylan H1 net down 43 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six months ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>    Net profit	    55.89    vs	 98.11</p>
<p>    Turnover	   2,318.65    vs    2,121.91</p>
<p>    Tax provision	 10.01    vs	 22.95</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. Seylan Bank Ltd is one of four private commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
